{"id": "t137-003", "text": "Caught up with Lena after work, finally. She and Kai broke up a fortnight ago, after nearly four years. She's mostly fine she says, but sleeping badly and not eating much. Kai's moved back to his mum's in Croydon for now. Her sister keeps sending her flat listings which isn't helping. I'm taking her for dinner Friday, somewhere with no memories attached.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight ago", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleeping badly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not eating much", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved back", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t137-005", "text": "Quick catch up w Sara. Applied for the Edinburgh role, hears back next week. Her sister Marisol is visiting Thursday to Sunday. Ask Sara on Monday if she's heard anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Edinburgh role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday to Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Sara", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-007", "text": "Kalani and Rin came round. Rin's interview at the museum went ok she thinks, they said they'd decide by Friday. Kalani's training for a half marathon in March. Rin loves the Ghibli stuff, bday's in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the museum", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ghibli stuff", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t137-008", "text": "Jamal rang. Got let go from the agency on Tuesday, whole team gone. He's surprisingly upbeat, already applying to three places. His partner Suzanne is nervous about money though. Should check in with him next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "let go from the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying to three places", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about money", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-010", "text": "Lunch with Abebe (Abe) and Moira. Moira's dog Biscuit had his operation yesterday, all fine, wearing the cone and sulking. Abe's off to Addis for his cousin's wedding next month, two weeks. The day before he flies they're having a big family meal at his aunt's. He's still job hunting too, had a phone screen with an insurance firm on Monday and they want him in for a second round after he's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abe", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abe", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Addis", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "The day before he flies", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big family meal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "job hunting", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "phone screen with an insurance firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "after he's back", "anchor": "e6"}]}
{"id": "t137-012", "text": "Miriam and Amy split up. Amy's moving out this weekend, Miriam keeps the flat and the cat Pepper. Miriam says she's relieved more than sad. Popping round with wine on Sunday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "keeps the flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening"}]}
{"id": "t137-014", "text": "Archie had his panel interview today at the uni. Said it was brutal, 5 people on the panel. They're ringing candidates tomorrow. Text him tomorrow evening whatever happens.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "panel interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-015", "text": "Talked to Wiremu on the phone. His nana died in the spring and they finally have the unveiling in Rotorua next month, whole family going. He's taking two weeks off. Ask about it when he's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nana", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "unveiling in Rotorua", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he's back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-016", "text": "Jack, Femi and Zainab at the pub. Jack's interview at Rolls Royce is Monday, he's weirdly chill about it, says he's done his prep. Femi just got engaged to Sophie!! Proposed on the beach in Cornwall last weekend, she cried, he cried. Zainab's started a pottery course on Wednesday nights and is obsessed, already made me a wonky mug. Must get Femi and Sophie a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at Rolls Royce", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "chill", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pottery course", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday nights", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "obsessed", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get Femi and Sophie a card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p9", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t137-017", "text": "Need to post the birthday parcel to Hana by Wednesday. Also pick up the dry cleaning and book the car in.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post the birthday parcel to Hana", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up the dry cleaning", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the car in", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t137-019", "text": "Manon is back from France. The funeral went as well as these things can, her brother Antoine did the eulogy. She's back at work Monday which seems too soon. Take her for lunch next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Manon", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Take her for lunch", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-020", "text": "Sara got it!! Edinburgh, starting in January. She's moving up with her partner after Christmas. Already planning a leaving party for mid December. Get her something nice for the new flat.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got it", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid December", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get her something nice for the new flat", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t137-021", "text": "Catch up w Kai. Says he's doing alright since the breakup, joined a climbing gym, goes Tues and Thurs. His boss is making him reapply for his own role in a restructure, interview Friday. He's pretty anxious. Wish him luck Thursday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing alright", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues and Thurs"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "restructure", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish him luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-024", "text": "Spoke to Aisha on the walk home. Her son starts nursery next week and she's back at work three days after, which she's dreading. Her husband's been job hunting since the summer, two interviews this week, one Tuesday and one Thursday. She's holding everything together and she's knackered. Her mum's offered to have the little one on Fridays. Aisha said she'd love a proper night out once things settle.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "three days after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "job hunting", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviews", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "holding everything together", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fridays"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a proper night out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d8", "type": "DATE", "text": "once things settle"}]}
{"id": "t137-025", "text": "Rin heard back from the museum this morning. Didn't get the job, they went with an internal candidate, which she says she half expected. She's gutted though, she'd already pictured herself there. Says she'll reapply when the next round opens in spring. Kalani is taking her to the coast this weekend to cheer her up. Send Rin something small, she likes those fancy matcha tins from the place in Soho.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reapply", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when the next round opens in spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking her to the coast", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send Rin something small", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fancy matcha tins from the place in Soho", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t137-026", "text": "Jamal's got an interview next Wednesday at a design studio in Leeds! First one since the redundancy. Suzanne says he's practising answers on her every night. Ask Jamal how it went on Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Jamal how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-029", "text": "Lindiwe passed her PhD interview, she's in! Adaeze threw a little party at theirs the next day. Lindiwe starts in October. She wants to frame the acceptance letter lol.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to frame the acceptance letter", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t137-031", "text": "Archie didn't get the uni job. They phoned the next morning. He's going to try the one at the college instead, deadline Friday. I said I'd read his cover letter tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next morning"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "try the one at the college", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow"}]}
{"id": "t137-032", "text": "Femi and Sophie's engagement party is Saturday the 14th at her parents' place. Need to sort a present. Sophie mentioned they want one of those fancy coffee machines.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "want one of those fancy coffee machines", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t137-036", "text": "Jack got the Rolls Royce job! Starts in three weeks. His girlfriend Hana says he's pretending to be cool about it but he's buzzing. They're doing a celebration dinner on Saturday. Congratulate Jack properly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rolls Royce job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in three weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "buzzing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebration dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Congratulate Jack properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t137-041", "text": "Abebe's back from Addis. The wedding was three days long apparently. His cousin's moving to London next spring so he'll see more of her. He's knackered and jet lagged.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to London", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "jet lagged", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t137-042", "text": "Dinner w Aisha and Anil. Anil's doing better, been back at work a month since his mum's funeral. He's taking his dad to Kerala at Easter to scatter her ashes. Aisha's husband got the job he interviewed for.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing better", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Easter", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scatter her ashes", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job", "owner": "r3", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t137-043", "text": "Sophie's been offered a promotion but it means relocating to Bristol. She has until next Friday to decide. Femi's not keen. She asked me to call her Sunday to talk it through.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "relocating to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until next Friday"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not keen", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t137-045", "text": "Lena got a callback for the head of marketing job, final round on the 22nd. She's prepping a presentation for it. Her dog Mochi ate one of her shoes the day before, chaos. Remind me to ask Lena how the final went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "callback for the head of marketing job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Lena how the final went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t137-046", "text": "Chris and his wife are expecting! Due in May. They told everyone at Tariq's after the funeral, which was a bit odd but lovely. Chris is already reading every baby book going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t137-048", "text": "Femi rang. His dad's been made redundant after thirty years at the plant, they told him on Friday with no warning. Femi's worried he'll just sit at home and stew, he's never not worked. His mum's trying to get him to see it as early retirement. His dad loves fishing, so maybe a day trip to the lakes. Femi wants to plan something for the weekend after next and asked if I'd come.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried he'll just sit at home and stew", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fishing", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "day trip to the lakes", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after next", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t137-049", "text": "Kwame quit the bank. Going back to his old job in a fortnight, they were thrilled. Feels a bit embarrassed. Tell him it's fine, honestly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quit the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "old job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit embarrassed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Tell him it's fine", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t137-053", "text": "Talked to Adaeze. She's applying for jobs in Glasgow so they can move when Lindiwe starts the PhD. Interview at the NHS Board next Monday by video. She's a bit nervous about doing it on camera.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying for jobs in Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interview at the NHS Board", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about doing it on camera", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t137-055", "text": "Hana's 30th is on the 8th! Jack's planning a surprise dinner the Saturday before. She's been hinting about wanting a record player. Chip in with Jack for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hinting about wanting a record player", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Chip in with Jack for it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t137-056", "text": "Amy got a teaching job! Year 4 at a primary in Hackney, starts after Easter. She's thrilled. Miriam texted me to say she's glad for her, which is nice. Send Amy congrats.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "teaching job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Year 4 at a primary in Hackney", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Easter", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "glad for her", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send Amy congrats", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t137-057", "text": "Kalani's piano exam is the same Thursday as Kerry's last day. Kerry's mum is taking Kalani. Kerry's leaving drinks are that evening at the Swan. I'll go straight after work.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "piano exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "straight after work"}]}
{"id": "t137-058", "text": "Jamal didn't get Leeds but they want him for freelance work. He's okay with it. Suzanne's still waiting to hear about her layoffs, they find out Monday. Text Suzanne Monday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay with it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "layoffs", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Suzanne", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
